---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Celebrating 10 Years of Excellence - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group celebrates 10 years of excellence in kitchen appliance manufacturing, reflecting on milestone achievements, global partnerships, and vision for the next decade of innovation.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Milestone</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Milestone</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Celebrating 10 Years of Excellence in Kitchen Appliance Manufacturing</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 April 2012</span>
            <span>🏷️ Milestone</span>
            <span>⏱️ 6 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ca8a04, #a16207);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">10 Years of Excellence</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>April 2012 marked a significant moment when HouseTech Group was founded with a simple mission: to manufacture kitchen appliances that enhance people's lives through thoughtful design and reliable performance. A decade later, that founding vision has expanded into a global enterprise serving partners in 40 countries while maintaining the craftsmanship and customer focus of those early days.</p>
          
          <p>Ten years represents both an achievement worth celebrating and a foundation for future growth. HouseTech's journey from a small workshop to an internationally recognized manufacturer reflects the dedication of team members past and present, and the trust placed in us by partners around the world.</p>
          
          <h2>A Decade of Growth</h2>
          <p>HouseTech's evolution over ten years demonstrates consistent progress:</p>
          
          <ul>
            <li><strong>2012:</strong> Founded with 50 employees in a 10,000 sq ft facility, focusing on domestic Chinese market.</li>
            <li><strong>2015:</strong> International expansion begins with Southeast Asian export partnerships.</li>
            <li><strong>2018:</strong> ISO 9001 certification achieved, validating quality management systems.</li>
            <li><strong>2020:</strong> R&D center established with 50 engineers driving innovation.</li>
            <li><strong>2022:</strong> Factory expansion completed, capacity reaching 1 million units annually.</li>
          </ul>

          <blockquote>
            "When we started HouseTech, we dreamed of becoming a trusted name in kitchen appliances. That dream has been realized through the hard work of our team and the loyalty of our partners. But we view the first decade as a prologue—the best chapters of HouseTech's story are still ahead."
            <cite>— HouseTech Group Founder and CEO</cite>
          </blockquote>

          <h2>Commitment to Partners</h2>
          <p>HouseTech's success is inseparable from the success of our OEM partners. Over ten years, we have built lasting relationships with brands that trust us to manufacture products representing their brand values. We are grateful for every partnership and committed to earning that trust every day.</p>
          
          <p>Our B2B partners benefit from HouseTech's manufacturing excellence, engineering expertise, and global market understanding. Whether establishing a new private label product line or expanding an existing range, HouseTech provides the manufacturing foundation for success.</p>

          <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
          <p>The next decade will bring new challenges and opportunities. Smart home integration, sustainability requirements, and evolving consumer preferences will reshape the kitchen appliance industry. HouseTech is prepared to lead through continued investment in R&D, manufacturing capability, and partner relationships.</p>
          
          <p>Sustainability is a particular focus, with targets for carbon-neutral operations and products designed for longevity and recyclability. HouseTech aims to demonstrate that responsible manufacturing and business success go hand in hand.</p>

          <p>Thank you to all who have been part of HouseTech's first decade journey. We invite you to join us for the exciting years ahead.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/18-month-product-development" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">18-Month Development Cycle</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/ces-2025-smart-kitchen-launch" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">CES 2025 Launch</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>